Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
-------------------------------------------------------

This fork was taken from the SciSpark repository at commit 435afcd and has
modified it. Every file of the upstream project that this fork changed is
listed, with the change, in docs/psychiatry/CHANGES.md, which is this fork's
statement of changes. The files this fork added are under src/lib/clinical/,
src/components/clinical/, src/app/api/clinical/, src/app/watch/,
src/app/notes/, src/app/outputs/, packs/ and docs/psychiatry/.

